1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:01,502
Mistaking a dog breed

2
00:00:01,502 --> 00:00:02,845
with AI is harmless,

3
00:00:02,845 --> 00:00:04,021
but a false positive

4
00:00:04,021 --> 00:00:05,198
on a toxic mushroom

5
00:00:05,198 --> 00:00:06,540
can be fatal.

6
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:07,972
The reason computer vision

7
00:00:07,972 --> 00:00:08,804
fails so badly

8
00:00:08,804 --> 00:00:09,980
is a physical trap

9
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,562
called visual occlusion.

10
00:00:11,613 --> 00:00:12,818
Take the death cap,

11
00:00:12,818 --> 00:00:14,097
a highly toxic mushroom

12
00:00:14,097 --> 00:00:15,272
AI frequently mistakes

13
00:00:15,272 --> 00:00:17,061
for a harmless edible.

14
00:00:17,112 --> 00:00:18,046
AI relies strictly

15
00:00:18,046 --> 00:00:19,490
on surface pixels.

16
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,371
From a top-down

17
00:00:20,371 --> 00:00:21,331
smartphone photo,

18
00:00:21,331 --> 00:00:22,302
the death cap's shape

19
00:00:22,302 --> 00:00:24,022
looks perfectly innocent.

20
00:00:24,072 --> 00:00:25,006
But human experts

21
00:00:25,006 --> 00:00:26,974
don't just look at the cap.

22
00:00:27,024 --> 00:00:27,752
To spot this

23
00:00:27,752 --> 00:00:28,677
specific threat,

24
00:00:28,677 --> 00:00:29,649
they check for a

25
00:00:29,649 --> 00:00:30,410
sack-like structure

26
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:32,377
at the base of the stem.

27
00:00:32,427 --> 00:00:33,875
But out in the wild,

28
00:00:33,875 --> 00:00:34,706
this crucial root

29
00:00:34,706 --> 00:00:35,778
is completely buried

30
00:00:35,778 --> 00:00:37,811
under soil and fallen leaves.

31
00:00:37,861 --> 00:00:38,692
Because it's blocked

32
00:00:38,692 --> 00:00:40,588
from the camera's line of sight

33
00:00:40,588 --> 00:00:41,894
that's visual occlusion

34
00:00:41,894 --> 00:00:43,580
the data doesn't exist.

35
00:00:43,631 --> 00:00:44,703
And this limitation

36
00:00:44,703 --> 00:00:46,530
goes deeper than the dirt.

37
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:47,411
Flipping the cap

38
00:00:47,411 --> 00:00:48,719
reveals pure white gills,

39
00:00:48,719 --> 00:00:50,409
which drop a white spore print,

40
00:00:50,409 --> 00:00:52,096
a classic warning sign.

41
00:00:52,147 --> 00:00:53,426
A 2D surface image

42
00:00:53,426 --> 00:00:54,360
can never capture

43
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:55,597
what's underneath.

44
00:00:55,647 --> 00:00:56,824
Because AI can't infer

45
00:00:56,824 --> 00:00:58,234
features it can't see,

46
00:00:58,234 --> 00:00:59,652
it makes life-or-death guesses

47
00:00:59,652 --> 00:01:01,474
using deceptive camouflage.

48
00:01:01,524 --> 00:01:03,075
And that deadly death cap,

49
00:01:03,075 --> 00:01:04,149
missing the buried root

50
00:01:04,149 --> 00:01:05,457
and hidden white gills,

51
00:01:05,457 --> 00:01:06,874
the AI confidently labels

52
00:01:06,874 --> 00:01:08,111
the lethal hazard:

53
00:01:08,111 --> 00:01:11,000
safe to eat.

